SUMMARY

Robotics technology is the design, construction, and use of robots to perform tasks automatically or with minimal human control.

📖 Explanation  
Robotics combines several fields like mechanical engineering, electronics, computer science, and artificial intelligence to create machines (robots) that can do jobs such as assembling products, exploring dangerous places, or helping in surgeries. Robots have sensors to understand their environment, processors to make decisions, and actuators (motors) to move or act.

Robotics technology helps improve efficiency, safety, and precision in many industries.

